# Protected evaluation suite.
#
# A release job places protected_set.json in this directory. Those questions
# stay out of git. Ignoring the whole directory from the repository .gitignore
# would be shorter, which is what we do for docs/local/, but then a clone would
# not have the folder. This file is the convenient version: the directory is
# visible and everything else in it is ignored.
*
!.gitignore
